---
layout: layouts/page.njk
pagination:
  data: states
  size: 1
  alias: state
permalink: "/states/{{ state.slug }}/lemon-law/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ state.name }} Lemon Law Guide — Know Your Rights"
  description: "Complete guide to {{ state.name }}'s lemon law protections: what qualifies as a lemon, how to file a claim, required repair attempts, and how to get a refund or replacement vehicle."
---

<div class="prose-dark">
{% set guide = stateGuides[state.slug] %}
{% if guide and guide.lemon %}
{% include "state-guides/" + state.slug + "/lemon-law.html" %}
{% else %}

<h2 id="overview">{{ state.name }} lemon law</h2>

{% if state.hasLemonLaw %}
<p>{{ state.lemonLawSummary }}</p>

{% if state.lemonLawCitation %}
<p>The statute is <a href="{{ state.lemonLawUrl }}" rel="noopener">{{ state.lemonLawCitation }}</a>.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if state.usedCarLemonLaw %}<p>{{ state.usedCarLemonLaw }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if state.lemonArbitration %}<p>{{ state.lemonArbitration }}</p>{% endif %}
{% else %}
<p>{{ state.name }} does not have a specific state lemon law on file here. A written warranty can still be enforced under the federal Magnuson-Moss Warranty Act, 15 U.S.C. sections 2301 through 2312.</p>
{% endif %}

<p><a href="/guides/lemon-law/qualification-checker/">Qualification checker</a>. <a href="/guides/lemon-law/notice-letter/">Notice-letter draft</a>.</p>

{% endif %}
<div class="glass-card metallic-border rounded-2xl p-8 carbon-panel text-center my-10 not-prose">
  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Think You Have a Lemon?</h3>
  <p class="text-silver-400 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">Connect with an experienced {{ state.name }} lemon law attorney for a free case evaluation. Most work on contingency with no upfront costs.</p>
  <a href="/go/lemon-law/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl btn-primary text-white font-bold text-sm">
    Free Lemon Law Consultation
    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"/></svg>
  </a>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[10px] text-silver-500/50">Affiliate link. We may earn a commission at no cost to you.</p>
</div>


</div>
